    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Exploring Fonts\r\n\r\nNotice that there is a new section of our webpage called `<style>`. This defines the rules for how the webpage should look.\r\n\r\nIn this level, we'll use AI Tutor to help us understand `font-family` and add a new font to our webpage.\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n1) Notice that there is also a new tag called `<link>`. This is used to load in new font to your website from Google Fonts.\r\n2) Ask AI Tutor to explain the rules for these new CSS elements.\r\n    - You can send AI Tutor a message directly, or highlight the code and select \"Add to AI Tutor\"\r\n3) Ask AI Tutor to update the paragraph text on this page. \r\n    - Use specific language, like \"`font-family`\" or \"Google Fonts `<link>`\", to make sure AI follows your vision.\r\n\r\nOnce you've added a font to the paragraphs: press the Continue button!",
